Description:
SH-48 (politician management UI) and SH-49 (manage data sources UI) describe admin screens but no backend story exists for them. server/src/routes/admin/sources.js serves hardcoded mock data from server/src/config/adminSources.js and is not mounted; there is no admin politicians route at all. This story provides the authenticated CRUD APIs and removes the mock.

Acceptance criteria — definition of done

* {{/api/admin/politicians}}: {{GET}} (list incl. {{needs_review}}), {{POST}}, {{PUT /:id}}, {{DELETE /:id}}; body validated (name, district, city required); delete returns 409 with an explanation when the politician has linked {{form700_filings}}
* {{/api/admin/sources}}: {{GET}} (type, last sync time, item count, last error), {{POST}}, {{PUT /:id}}, {{DELETE /:id}}; delete preserves already-ingested {{agenda_items}}
* {{POST}} / {{PUT}} on a Legistar source performs a live test call through {{server/src/legistar-api.js}} ({{getMeetings(baseUrl, 1)}}) and returns 400 with the upstream error if it fails; Apify sources validate the actor id via the Apify API
* {{POST /api/admin/sources/:id/sync}} triggers {{runLegistarSyncForCity}} or {{runApifyAgendaScrape}} for that source and returns a run id whose status can be read from {{sync_logs}}
* All routes sit behind {{requireAdmin}} and return 401 without a valid session — verified with raw HTTP calls
* {{server/src/config/adminSources.js}} is deleted and {{client/app/routes/admin.sources.tsx}} reads live data from the new endpoints
* Integration tests cover create / edit / delete for both resources plus the blocked-delete case

The GitHub Actions workflow is committed as .github/workflows/ci-cdyml.yml.txt — GitHub ignores the .txt extension, so CI has never run despite SH-38 being Done. The workflow calls npm test and prisma migrate deploy, yet the three parser unit tests under server/tests/unit/ assert camelCase keys (entityName) while the parsers return snake_case (entity_name), and pass file paths where the parsers expect buffers, so they fail when run. SH-34, SH-51 and SH-63 cannot pass until the runner is green.

Acceptance criteria — definition of done

* {{.github/workflows/ci-cdyml.yml.txt}} renamed to {{.github/workflows/ci.yml}}; it appears in the repository's Actions tab and runs on every PR to {{dev}} and {{main}}
* {{vitest}} and {{supertest}} are declared as devDependencies and {{@prisma/client}} / {{prisma}} as dependencies in {{server/package.json}}, with scripts {{"test": "vitest run tests/unit"}} and {{"test:integration": "vitest run tests/integration"}}
* {{prisma generate}} and {{prisma migrate deploy}} steps succeed in CI against the Postgres service container
* {{scheduleA.test.js}}, {{scheduleB.test.js}} and {{scheduleCDE.test.js}} updated to pass buffers and assert snake_case fields; {{npm test}} passes locally with 0 failures
* The CI run is green on a PR to {{dev}} and the {{test}} job is marked as a required status check so a red run blocks merge
* Deploy job targets Railway (matching {{README.md}} and SH-60) and runs only on push to {{main}}
